# 後端 image 的 build context 白名單：只放 apps/api、關卡資料與重播驗證器原始碼，其餘全排除
# （context 在 repo 根目錄，見 .github/workflows/deploy-api.yml 的 context: .）
*
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps
apps/*
!apps/api
apps/api/.venv
apps/api/__pycache__
!apps/simulator
apps/simulator/*
!apps/simulator/public
apps/simulator/public/*
!apps/simulator/public/levels
# 重播驗證器（J-02）：Dockerfile 的 replay-verifier 階段以 esbuild 打包
!apps/simulator/tsconfig.json
!apps/simulator/src
!apps/simulator/scripts
apps/simulator/scripts/.cache
!packages
packages/*
!packages/shared
packages/shared/*
!packages/shared/src
.dockerignore
